    "Place every gun-parented piece at origin (or rotate it about pivot_gun). Hook-parented pieces hang off the hook pivot via pivot_in_hook.",
    "Loaded: hook pivot sits at pieces[hook].pivot_gun; its shaft and rope eye hide inside the muzzle. Fired: move the hook pivot freely and rotate it to the flight direction.",
    "trigger: rotate by 0..trigger_pull_deg about its pivot (tip swings back toward the grip).",
    "needle: drawn at full pressure; rotate toward needle_empty_deg as the gas is spent.",
    "drum: spin as rope pays out (clockwise) or reels in (counter-clockwise).",
    "prongs: 0 = open (as drawn); prong_fold_deg sweeps them back along the shaft for flight."
